# LF everywhere (CLAUDE.md → Conventions). Git stores text files with LF and checks them out with LF,
# on Linux, macOS and Windows alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their line endings.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tgz   binary
